{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/3/20358c003acd67255c8b823f532e0f7d4e4b26c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-y^2-z^2+2yz+x+y-z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"241\" height=\"18\" /> has:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/a/44a965980f0565d1d9d7338f42ffa3b5cb3ac883.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\text{no linear factor with integer coefficients and integer exponents} \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(B)}\\ \\text{the factor }-x+y+z \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(C)}\\ \\text{the factor }x-y-z+1 \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\text{the factor }x+y-z+1 \\qquad \\\\ \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{the factor }x-y+z+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"487\" height=\"96\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Factor the perfect square trinomial.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/7/10722548328a889b191f586d439cc513f0e270fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2 - (y-z)^2 + x + y - z\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"20\" />\nFactor the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Difference_of_squares\" title=\"Difference of squares\">difference of squares</a>.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4bd89edaa7c8243d439f5f22e3ed36c52d3eae7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+y-z)(x-y+z) + x + y - z\\]\" width=\"269\" height=\"18\" />\nFactor by grouping.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/c/6bc503fa83019ddfd2218f71dc4ba11d51a010eb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(x+y-z)(x-y+z+1)\\]\" width=\"203\" height=\"18\" />\nThe answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/f/6bfc0829f3f29bbf35d0a861644e00cfef0f50ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"39\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wi